# The forest beetle's body (#327, D101): the `dead` frame of beetle.grid, pixel for pixel. Since #571 (D117, the author,
# 2026-11-21) it keeps the live beetle's palette, ink contour and moon rim, exactly as the `dead` frame: no decor recolour,
# no tint, no halo. The pose on its back is the cue that it is dead (it differs from every live frame, RemainsTest); the
# body rocks when the hero passes (reactive, not idle). Keep it in step with beetle.grid: same keys, same colours.
size 24 16
color k 0b0814
color d 4a0c22
color t 86101f
color s 9c2050
color h b85a80
color n 2a0612
color L 9a6070
frame body
